+\kpicaveat{Reviewer caveat.} The passive-RF-only diagnostic has higher AP and swept Recall@$\leq$1\%FPR than the locked EI candidate, but worse selected-threshold F1 and ECE. This is an important red flag, not a result to hide. It means passive-RF provenance is strong in this single-seed run and should be stressed in future multi-seed and missingness-heavy corpora.
+
